 "notes": [
  "General education courses require a grade of C or higher.",
  "The AA needs 60 credits: 36 general education (15 State Core + 21 MDC Core) plus 24 pathway electives.",
  "Each math/humanities/social science/natural science area needs one State Core course and one different MDC Core course.",
  "Gordon Rule: 6 credits of writing-intensive English plus 6 more credits of writing-intensive coursework, and 6 credits of college algebra-level or higher math.",
  "Civic literacy: one of AMH 2010, AMH 2020 or POS 2041 can also count in Social Sciences."
